

hair styles/types:
## Very Short / Shaved
    **Buzz Cut** — Hair clipped uniformly close to the scalp.  
    **Crew Cut** — Slightly longer on top than the sides, very short and neat.  
    **Shaved Head** — Completely shaved or nearly bald.  
    **Fade** — Hair tapers from very short at the neck to slightly longer on top.  
## Short
    **Pixie Cut** — Short with slightly longer top and wispy, textured edges.  
    **Taper Cut** — Short on sides and back, gradually longer on top.  
    **Undercut** — Sides and back shaved or very short, top left longer.  
    **Side Part** — Short to medium length with a clean side parting.  
    **Curly Crop** — Short all over with natural curls or coils kept close to the head. 
    **Short Bangs** — Short style with straight or textured bangs across the forehead.
## Medium
    **Bob** — Hair cut straight around the head at jaw-to-shoulder length.  
    **Long Bob** — Bob that falls just above or at the shoulders.  
    **Shag** — Layered medium cut with feathered ends and a messy, textured look.    
    **Curly Shag** — Layered medium cut with natural curls for volume and bounce.  
    **Shoulder-Length** — Hair falling neatly to the shoulders, blunt or lightly layered.
    **Twists** — Two-strand twists falling to medium length, natural or added hair.
## Long
    **Long & Straight** — Hair below the shoulders, sleek and smooth.  
    **Long & Wavy** — Below-shoulder hair with soft, loose waves.  
    **Long & Curly** — Long hair with defined curls or coils.  
    **Dreadlocks / Locs** — Rope-like sections of matted or twisted hair, often long.  
    **Classic Long** — Extremely long, natural hair falling past the mid-back.  
    **Long Ponytail** — Long hair pulled back into a tail, sleek or textured.  
    **Long Braid** — A single long braid down the back, tight or loose.  
    **Long Messy Bun** — Long hair gathered into a soft, voluminous bun.  
    **Long Glossy Waves** — Long hair with polished, shiny waves.  
    **Long Sleek Ponytail** — Very long hair pulled into a smooth, high or low ponytail.

